        "name": "text",
        "text": "<h1>Tiny Python workshop</h1>\n<p>Learn to describe a value and predict a small program.</p>\n<p>This demonstration is original and can be used without a Stepik account.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Value</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>4</code></td>\n<td>An integer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&quot;four&quot;</code></td>\n<td>A string</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
